.com/sites/vikrammittal/2026/01/25/russias-new-ai-system-aims-to-fix-front-line-decision-making/","line":38},{"title":"ejecutan y acumulan bajas","target":"https://www.forbes.com/sites/vikrammittal/2026/01/16/ukraines-battlefield-defense-is-forcing-russia-to-adapt-its-tactics/","line":40},{"title":"decisiones más coherentes","target":"https://www.forbes.com/sites/vikrammittal/2026/01/25/russias-new-ai-system-aims-to-fix-front-line-decision-making/","line":42},{"title":"como Minority Report","target":"https://www.xataka.com/seguridad/minority-report-no-ciencia-ficcion-unos-investigadores-han-creado-algoritmo-que-predice-crimenes-al-90","line":44},{"title":"un problema de predicción","target":"https://understandingwar.org/research/russia-ukraine/russian-offensive-campaign-assessment-january-22-2026/","line":46},{"title":"![Hay gente obsesionada con consumir magnesio como suplemento cuando la mejor forma es meterlo en tu dieta","target":"https://i.blogs.es/69366c/mind-favour-h1sdi0ii2bm-unsplash/375_142.jpeg","line":48},{"title":"Hay gente obsesionada con consumir magnesio como suplemento cuando la mejor forma es meterlo en tu dieta","target":"https://www.xataka.com/medicina-y-salud/hay-gente-obsesionada-consumir-magnesio-como-suplemento-cuando-mejor-forma-meterlo-tu-dieta","line":50},{"title":"la identificación de objetivos","target":"https://understandingwar.org/research/russia-ukraine/russian-offensive-campaign-assessment-january-22-2026/","line":52},{"title":"aprende y cambia de patrón","target":"https://www.forbes.com/sites/vikrammittal/2024/02/16/ukrainian-commercial-sector-to-develop-electronic-warfare-systems/","line":52},{"title":"la realidad del frente","target":"https://www.forbes.com/sites/vikrammittal/2026/01/25/russias-new-ai-system-aims-to-fix-front-line-decision-making/","line":52},{"title":"adaptado con rapidez","target":"https://understandingwar.org/research/russia-ukraine/russian-offensive-campaign-assessment-january-22-2026/","line":54},{"title":"co